  "Specification": "This module specifies an abstract termination-detection problem for a ring with synchronous communication. It models a set of nodes indexed by Node, where each node may be active or inactive, and a boolean flag records whether global termination has been detected. The actions allow active nodes to terminate, active nodes to wake up other nodes, and a separate detection step to set the detection flag when all nodes are inactive; the specification also states a fairness condition on the detection action and defines correctness, quiescence, and liveness-style temporal properties.",
